---
description: Solidity / ENSv2 engineering rules
globs: contracts/**,packages/registry/**,packages/ens/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Sepolia only. After every deploy, write address+block+abiHash+timestamp to
/deployments/sepolia.json via script — never hand-edit an address into .env.
Write order for a TAINTED incident is fixed: (1) register ENS subname,
(2) capture node hash, (3) write registry entry containing that node hash.
Registry writes are idempotent — check target+fingerprint before insert;
a retried write returns the existing record, never a duplicate.
Relayer key: dedicated Sepolia-only wallet, server env var only.
No tokens, staking, or governance contracts.
